<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>M249 Macro (8x)

only works with the 8x (You can try laser + gloves)
+ you have to move your mouse slightly down with it (so it isn't perfect "norecoil")

in-game Settings should be set to:

FOV 90 - Sensitivity 0.82
(graphics.fov 90)
(input.sensitivity 0.82)


Personally used Settings:

Driver should be turned on to be more legit.
Snap to Window is off
Mentioned before: FOV (graphics.fov 90 in F1) and Sensitivity (input.sensitivity 0.82 in F1)
Mouse used: Trust GXT 105  ///   DPI: 1600
if possible put it on Mouse Button 1 (Left Click)


Personally used Key Settings:

Use minimal delay when pressing keys in macros: ON
React only to physical clicks on keyboards and mice: ON
Block modifier keystrokes: ON</Description>
    <Comment>Enjoy it~</Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>1</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>LeftDown 1
Delay 10 ms
MoveR 0 8
Delay 6 ms
MoveR 0 8
Delay 6 ms
MoveR 0 8
Delay 6 ms
MoveR 0 8
Delay 6 ms
MoveR 0 7
Delay 6 ms
MoveR 0 7
Delay 6 ms
MoveR 0 7
Delay 5 ms
MoveR 0 6
Delay 5 ms
MoveR 0 6
Delay 5 ms
MoveR 0 6
Delay 5 ms
MoveR 0 6
Delay 50 ms
LeftUp 1</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Rust</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>